    airo:evidenceText "On its website ElevenLabs offers both “speech synthesis” and “voice cloning.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2552" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/daf83fd01985> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "AI-Generated Voice Firm Clamps Down After 4chan Makes Celebrity Voices for Abuse" ;
