<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/30254dd3ff15> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The generative AI marketplace, led by OpenAI, is absolutely red hot, and startups have a better chance of securing VC funding if they have a product" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8027" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3dcaeded2b2c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Henry Ajder, an expert in deepfakes and generative AI, said: \"What they [ElevenLabs] have developed, technologically, is very impressive [but] by opening up these models they have made, unfortunately, a fairly naive judgment about the intentions of those people out there who will use those models." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2668" .

